    "body": "Pin 1 covers the automatic entry. The issue title itself accepts a user-selected Helix, Ramp or Plunge with a warning, so a selected Ramp that runs below the material top with its advisory Warning::EntryNotRecommended is inside the done criterion: the automatic entry on a start-side pass has no helix and no ramp, and a selected entry is allowed with its warning. We cannot close the issue from this account; the close stands on this sentence.",
